WHY THIS SOURCE IS PUBLISHED

This repository is published so that the people who use EmpowerTours Hunt and
Cota can see exactly how it works. The product makes claims that are only worth
anything if they can be checked: that a signed trading bound is enforced by a
pure function that fails closed, that a private note is sealed in the browser
with a key the server never holds, that analytics never receives a wallet
address. Those are verifiable here, by reading the code.

Transparency is the entire purpose. This is NOT an open-source licence and
grants no right to use this work in your own.

WHAT YOU MAY DO

  1. Read, study and audit this source code.
  2. Quote short excerpts for commentary, review, teaching or security
     reporting, with attribution.
  3. Use the official EmpowerTours services at the domains EmpowerTours
     operates, under their own terms.
  4. Run the code locally for the sole purpose of verifying the claims above,
     or of evaluating a submission to a hackathon or similar review.

